{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Objective:
    Create a unique and visually striking Featured Product section that aligns with the website’s modern and minimalist design language.
    
    1. Layout & Structure
    Container: Full-width section with padding on sides (responsive to viewport width).
    Grid Layout: Use a flexible two-column grid on desktop; single column stacked on mobile.
    Left Column: Large product image with subtle shadow and hover zoom effect.
    Right Column:
    Product title (large, bold font)
    Short product description (light font weight)
    Price with discount if applicable (discount crossed out with red color)
    Star rating component with half-star support
    Call-to-action button with smooth hover animation
    Additional small badge for “New” or “Limited Edition” as applicable
    2. Visual Style
    Colors: Use the primary brand color for buttons and accents.
    Typography: Sans-serif font consistent with site font.
    Animations:
    Image zoom on hover
    Button color fade on hover
    Subtle fade-in of section on page load
    Unique Touch: Diagonal split background behind text column using CSS clip-path with light gradient matching site palette.
    3. Interaction & Behavior
    **Responsive Design:
    
    On mobile devices, stack the image on top and the product info below with appropriate spacing.
    Ensure touch-friendly button sizes and spacing.
    Adjust font sizes and padding for smaller screens.
    Accessibility:
    
    Use semantic HTML elements (e.g., <section>, <h2>, <p>, <button>).
    Provide alt text for product images.
    Ensure high contrast for text and buttons.
    Keyboard navigable buttons and focus styles.
    Dynamic Content Support:
    
    Accept product data via props or API integration (image URL, title, description, price, discount, rating, badges).
    Gracefully handle missing data (e.g., no discount or rating).
    4. Data Structure (Example)
    const featuredProduct = {
      id: '12345',
      title: 'Ultra Comfort Running Shoes',
      description: 'Breathable, lightweight shoes designed for maximum comfort during your runs.',
      imageUrl: '/images/products/running-shoes.jpg',
      price: 120.00,
      discountPrice: 90.00,
      rating: 4.5,
      badges: ['New', 'Limited Edition'],
    };
    
    5. Sample HTML + CSS Outline (React JSX style)
    <section className="featured-product" aria-labelledby="featured-product-title">
      <div className="container grid">
        <div className="image-wrapper">
          <img src={featuredProduct.imageUrl} alt={featuredProduct.title} />
        </div>
        <div className="product-info">
          {featuredProduct.badges.length > 0 && (
            <div className="badges">
              {featuredProduct.badges.map(badge => (
                <span key={badge} className={`badge badge--${badge.toLowerCase().replace(' ', '-')}`}>
                  {badge}
                </span>
              ))}
            </div>
          )}
          <h2 id="featured-product-title">{featuredProduct.title}</h2>
          <p className="description">{featuredProduct.description}</p>
          <div className="pricing">
            {featuredProduct.discountPrice ? (
              <>
                <span className="price price--discount">${featuredProduct.discountPrice.toFixed(2)}</span>
                <span className="price price--original">${featuredProduct.price.toFixed(2)}</span>
              </>
            ) : (
              <span className="price">${featuredProduct.price.toFixed(2)}</span>
            )}
          </div>
          <div className="rating" aria-label={`Rating: ${featuredProduct.rating} out of 5`}>
            {/* Implement star rating rendering here */}
          </div>
          <button className="btn btn-primary">Buy Now</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    
    6. Key CSS Concepts
    .featured-product {
      padding: 4rem 2rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7fa 0%, #c3cfe2 100%);
    }
    
    .container.grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 3rem;
    }
    
    .image-wrapper img {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }
    .image-wrapper img:hover {
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }
    
    .product-info {
      position: relative;
      background: white;
      padding: 2rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 85% 100%, 0% 100%);
    }
    
    .badge {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      margin-right: 0.5rem;
    }
    
    .badge--new {
      background-color: #ff6f61;
      color: white;
    }
    
    .badge--limited-edition {
      background-color: #6b46c1;
      color: white;
    }
    
    .price {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    
    .price--original {
      text-decoration: line-through;
      color: #a0a0a0;
      margin-left: 1rem;
    }
    
    .btn-primary {
      background-color: #0070f3;
      color: white;
      padding: .75rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: .5rem;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background-color .3s ease;
    }
    
    .btn-primary:hover,
    .btn-primary:focus {
      background-color: #005bb5;
    }
    
    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width:768px) {
      .container.grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 2rem;
      }
    }
    
    , Requirements:
    
    Image Position Toggle:
    Add a backend toggle (e.g., in Shopify theme settings or metafields) that allows switching the featured product image between the left panel and the right panel.
    
    Scroll Animation:
    Make the featured product image move slightly (e.g., translate vertically up to 50px) when the user scrolls down the page to add subtle interactive motion.
    
    Bundle Benefits Icons:
    Display 3 icons with short benefit descriptions below or near the featured product text. These icons should represent key bundle benefits such as savings, free shipping, and bonus items.
    
    Additional Notes:
    
    The toggle should be easy to update without code changes (via theme customize or metafields).
    The icons and their texts should be editable in the backend as well.
    Use lightweight, smooth animations that perform well on desktop and mobile and also mobile friendly.
    auto scroll for photos that i can adjust how fast it changes
    , please change the offset shape look of the background for the information on the products. make this more normal
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-featured-product-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_sides }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    background: {{ block.settings.background_gradient_start }};
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.background_gradient_start }} 0%, {{ block.settings.background_gradient_end }} 100%);
    animation: ai-featured-product-fade-in-{{ ai_gen_id }} 0.8s ease-out;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  @keyframes ai-featured-product-fade-in-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(20px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  .ai-featured-product-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.grid_gap }}px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  {% if block.settings.image_position == 'right' %}
    .ai-featured-product-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      order: 2;
    }
    .ai-featured-product-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      order: 1;
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-featured-product-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, {{ block.settings.image_shadow_opacity }});
    will-change: transform;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    transition: transform 0.5s ease;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-featured-product-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .ai-featured-product-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 60%;
    height: 60%;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-gallery-track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    transition: transform 0.6s ease-in-out;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-gallery-slide-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    min-width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-gallery-slide-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-gallery-dots-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 16px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-gallery-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-gallery-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1);
    transform: scale(1.3);
  }

  .ai-featured-product-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    background: {{ block.settings.info_background }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.info_padding }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.info_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-badges-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.badge_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    display: inline-block;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-badge-new-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.badge_new_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.badge_new_text }};
  }

  .ai-featured-product-badge-limited-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.badge_limited_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.badge_limited_text }};
  }

  .ai-featured-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    margin: 0 0 24px 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.price_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.price_color }};
  }

  .ai-featured-product-price-original-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.price_original_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: {{ block.settings.price_original_color }};
    text-decoration: line-through;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-rating-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-star-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.star_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.star_size }}px;
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-star-full-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.star_color }};
  }

  .ai-featured-product-star-empty-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.star_empty_color }};
  }

  .ai-featured-product-star-half-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    color: {{ block.settings.star_empty_color }};
  }

  .ai-featured-product-star-half-{{ ai_gen_id }}::before {
    content: '★';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    width: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: {{ block.settings.star_color }};
  }

  .ai-featured-product-rating-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.rating_text_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    margin-left: 8px;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    padding: 20px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .ai-featured-product-benefit-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-benefit-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.benefit_icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.benefit_icon_size }}px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.benefit_icon_bg }};
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: {{ block.settings.benefit_icon_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.benefit_icon_size | times: 0.5 }}px;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-benefit-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.benefit_text_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    border: none;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-featured-product-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover,
  .ai-featured-product-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_bg }};
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .ai-featured-product-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top | times: 0.6 }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_sides | times: 0.5 }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom | times: 0.6 }}px;
    }

    .ai-featured-product-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: {{ block.settings.grid_gap | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-featured-product-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-featured-product-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      order: initial;
    }

    .ai-featured-product-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.info_padding | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-featured-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-featured-product-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.description_font_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }

    .ai-featured-product-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.price_font_size | times: 0.85 }}px;
    }

    .ai-featured-product-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .ai-featured-product-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
      padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical | times: 1.2 }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<featured-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}
  class="ai-featured-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
  data-scroll-enabled="{{ block.settings.enable_scroll_animation }}"
  data-scroll-distance="{{ block.settings.scroll_distance }}"
  data-autoplay="{{ block.settings.enable_autoplay }}"
  data-autoplay-speed="{{ block.settings.autoplay_speed }}"
  aria-labelledby="ai-featured-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  <div class="ai-featured-product-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-featured-product-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-scroll-target>
      {% if block.settings.product.images.size > 1 %}
        <div class="ai-featured-product-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-featured-product-gallery-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-gallery-track>
            {% for image in block.settings.product.images limit: 5 %}
              <div class="ai-featured-product-gallery-slide-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <img
                  src="{{ image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
                  alt="{{ image.alt | escape }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="{{ image.width }}"
                  height="{{ image.height }}"
                >
              </div>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
          <div class="ai-featured-product-gallery-dots-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-gallery-dots>
            {% for image in block.settings.product.images limit: 5 %}
              <button
                class="ai-featured-product-gallery-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {% if forloop.first %}active{% endif %}"
                data-slide-index="{{ forloop.index0 }}"
                aria-label="Go to slide {{ forloop.index }}"
              ></button>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>
      {% elsif block.settings.product.featured_image %}
        <img
          src="{{ block.settings.product.featured_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
          alt="{{ block.settings.product.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
          class="ai-featured-product-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          loading="lazy"
          width="{{ block.settings.product.featured_image.width }}"
          height="{{ block.settings.product.featured_image.height }}"
        >
      {% else %}
        <div class="ai-featured-product-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-featured-product-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.show_badges %}
        <div class="ai-featured-product-badges-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.show_new_badge %}
            <span class="ai-featured-product-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-featured-product-badge-new-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.new_badge_text }}
            </span>
          {% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.show_limited_badge %}
            <span class="ai-featured-product-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-featured-product-badge-limited-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.limited_badge_text }}
            </span>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      <h2
        id="ai-featured-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        class="ai-featured-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
      >
        {% if block.settings.product %}
          {{ block.settings.product.title }}
        {% else %}
          {{ block.settings.fallback_title }}
        {% endif %}
      </h2>

      <p class="ai-featured-product-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.product and block.settings.product.description != blank %}
          {{ block.settings.product.description | strip_html | truncate: 200 }}
        {% else %}
          {{ block.settings.fallback_description }}
        {% endif %}
      </p>

      <div class="ai-featured-product-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.product %}
          {% if block.settings.product.compare_at_price > block.settings.product.price %}
            <span class="ai-featured-product-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.product.price | money }}
            </span>
            <span class="ai-featured-product-price-original-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.product.compare_at_price | money }}
            </span>
          {% else %}
            <span class="ai-featured-product-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.product.price | money }}
            </span>
          {% endif %}
        {% else %}
          <span class="ai-featured-product-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">$120.00</span>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      {% if block.settings.show_rating %}
        <div
          class="ai-featured-product-rating-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          role="img"
          aria-label="Rating: {{ block.settings.rating_value }} out of 5 stars"
        >
          {% assign rating = block.settings.rating_value %}
          {% assign full_stars = rating | floor %}
          {% assign has_half = rating | modulo: 1 %}
          {% assign empty_stars = 5 | minus: full_stars %}
          {% if has_half >= 0.5 %}
            {% assign empty_stars = empty_stars | minus: 1 %}
          {% endif %}

          {% for i in (1..full_stars) %}
            <span class="ai-featured-product-star-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-featured-product-star-full-{{ ai_gen_id }}">★</span>
          {% endfor %}

          {% if has_half >= 0.5 %}
            <span class="ai-featured-product-star-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-featured-product-star-half-{{ ai_gen_id }}">★</span>
          {% endif %}

          {% for i in (1..empty_stars) %}
            <span class="ai-featured-product-star-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-featured-product-star-empty-{{ ai_gen_id }}">★</span>
          {% endfor %}

          <span class="ai-featured-product-rating-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            ({{ block.settings.rating_value }})
          </span>
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.show_benefits %}
        <div class="ai-featured-product-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.benefit_1_text != blank %}
            <div class="ai-featured-product-benefit-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-featured-product-benefit-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.benefit_1_icon }}
              </div>
              <div class="ai-featured-product-benefit-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.benefit_1_text }}
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.benefit_2_text != blank %}
            <div class="ai-featured-product-benefit-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-featured-product-benefit-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.benefit_2_icon }}
              </div>
              <div class="ai-featured-product-benefit-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.benefit_2_text }}
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.benefit_3_text != blank %}
            <div class="ai-featured-product-benefit-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-featured-product-benefit-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.benefit_3_icon }}
              </div>
              <div class="ai-featured-product-benefit-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.benefit_3_text }}
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.product %}
        <a
          href="{{ block.settings.product.url }}"
          class="ai-featured-product-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        >
          {{ block.settings.button_label }}
        </a>
      {% else %}
        <button class="ai-featured-product-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.button_label }}
        </button>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</featured-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class FeaturedProduct{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
        this.scrollEnabled = this.dataset.scrollEnabled === 'true';
        this.scrollDistance = parseInt(this.dataset.scrollDistance) || 50;
        this.autoplayEnabled = this.dataset.autoplay === 'true';
        this.autoplaySpeed = parseInt(this.dataset.autoplaySpeed) || 3000;
        this.scrollTarget = this.querySelector('[data-scroll-target]');
        this.galleryTrack = this.querySelector('[data-gallery-track]');
        this.galleryDots = this.querySelectorAll('[data-slide-index]');
        this.currentSlide = 0;
        this.autoplayInterval = null;
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        if (this.scrollEnabled && this.scrollTarget) {
          this.initScrollAnimation();
        }

        if (this.galleryTrack && this.galleryDots.length > 0) {
          this.initGallery();
        }
      }

      disconnectedCallback() {
        if (this.scrollEnabled) {
          window.removeEventListener('scroll', this.handleScroll);
        }
        if (this.autoplayInterval) {
          clearInterval(this.autoplayInterval);
        }
      }

      initScrollAnimation() {
        this.handleScroll = this.handleScroll.bind(this);
        window.addEventListener('scroll', this.handleScroll, { passive: true });
      }

      handleScroll() {
        const scrolled = window.pageYOffset;
        const elementTop = this.offsetTop;
        const elementHeight = this.offsetHeight;
        const windowHeight = window.innerHeight;

        if (scrolled + windowHeight > elementTop && scrolled < elementTop + elementHeight) {
          const scrollProgress = (scrolled + windowHeight - elementTop) / (windowHeight + elementHeight);
          const translateY = Math.min(scrollProgress * this.scrollDistance, this.scrollDistance);
          
          if (this.scrollTarget) {
            this.scrollTarget.style.transform = `translateY(-${translateY}px)`;
          }
        }
      }

      initGallery() {
        this.galleryDots.forEach((dot) => {
          dot.addEventListener('click', () => {
            const slideIndex = parseInt(dot.dataset.slideIndex);
            this.goToSlide(slideIndex);
          });
        });

        if (this.autoplayEnabled) {
          this.startAutoplay();
          
          this.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => this.stopAutoplay());
          this.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => this.startAutoplay());
        }
      }

      goToSlide(index) {
        this.currentSlide = index;
        const slideWidth = this.galleryTrack.querySelector('.ai-featured-product-gallery-slide-{{ ai_gen_id }}').offsetWidth;
        this.galleryTrack.style.transform = `translateX(-${index * slideWidth}px)`;

        this.galleryDots.forEach((dot, i) => {
          if (i === index) {
            dot.classList.add('active');
          } else {
            dot.classList.remove('active');
          }
        });
      }

      startAutoplay() {
        if (!this.autoplayEnabled || this.galleryDots.length <= 1) return;
        
        this.autoplayInterval = setInterval(() => {
          this.currentSlide = (this.currentSlide + 1) % this.galleryDots.length;
          this.goToSlide(this.currentSlide);
        }, this.autoplaySpeed);
      }

      stopAutoplay() {
        if (this.autoplayInterval) {
          clearInterval(this.autoplayInterval);
          this.autoplayInterval = null;
        }
      }
    }

    customElements.define('featured-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}', FeaturedProduct{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

